Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.98,0:00:03.85,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.60,0:00:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你刚刚是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, what was that all about back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.81,0:00:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,易形者已经死了之后的那几枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}All those extra shots after the shifter was already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.21,0:00:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定那不是…和血印有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure it wasn't something to do with the mark?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.18,0:00:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. None of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.15,0:00:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man, I gotta be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.07,0:00:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有点焦虑 我想要确保自己没做错什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a little anxious. I wanted to make sure it was done right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.80,0:00:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么还要解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why am I even explaining this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.10,0:00:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I …
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.19,0:00:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么做到的 - 魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How did you do it? - Magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.05,0:00:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是来找这个女巫的 罗威娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here for the witch. Rowena.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.82,0:00:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,能被认出来总是很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always nice to be recognized.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.40,0:00:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.88,0:00:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们抓住了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.06,0:00:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,该给我致命一击了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time for the coup de grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.90,0:00:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.17,0:00:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.39,0:00:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我名叫吉米·诺瓦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Jimmy Novak.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.13,0:00:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自伊利诺伊州的庞蒂亚克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm from Pontiac, Illinois.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.63,0:00:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个家庭 艾米莉娅和克莱尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a family … Amelia and Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.87,0:00:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢你赐予的食物 我们将无比珍惜你的恩赐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bless this food and ourselves to thy loving service.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.23,0:00:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.19,0:00:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.64,0:00:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你占据了个可怜虫的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're possessing some poor bastard?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.14,0:00:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥 你答应过我 我家人会没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel! You promised me my family would be okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.92,0:00:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些我们为了任务而牺牲的人类呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What of the humans whose lives we sacrifice?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.11,0:00:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许现在该把他们摆在第一位了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's time to put them first.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.53,0:00:57.62,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.18,0:01:25.27,Note,0,0,0,0,,（伊利诺伊州 庞蒂亚克）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.44,0:01:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰我 你个变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your hands off me, perv.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.00,0:01:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我告你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll sue your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.36,0:01:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次又怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was it this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.66,0:01:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,商店盗窃 那人不打算提出指控\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoplifting. The guy ain't lookin' to press charges,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.99,0:01:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我想你大概会想要她回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I figured you'd want her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.34,0:01:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要关48小时禁闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's 48 hours in isolation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.44,0:01:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好怕怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.81,0:02:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这姑娘是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.62,0:02:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,经常出走的孩子之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of our frequent flyers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.64,0:02:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔·诺瓦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire Novak.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.99,0:02:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺瓦克 你有访客\N{\fnArial\fs30}Novak, you got a visitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.19,0:02:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.69,0:02:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸爸来见你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father's here to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.37,0:02:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.20,0:02:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是你父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.01,0:02:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 克莱尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.27,0:02:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好久不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.79,0:02:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第10季第9集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.29,0:03:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,能让我们单独谈谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we have a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.53,0:03:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.21,0:03:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是你父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.61,0:03:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.42,0:03:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我不是你父亲」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I'm not your father."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.73,0:03:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你对我说的第一句话 记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those were the first words you ever said to me. Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.66,0:03:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.46,0:03:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是 卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}So do I, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.46,0:03:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.23,0:03:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还在你身体里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he still in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.69,0:03:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.79,0:03:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,人的灵魂 只能占据一具\N{\fnArial\fs30}The human soul, it can only occupy a body.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.74,0:03:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,具有一定结构完整性的躯体\N{\fnArial\fs30}while it retains a certain… structural integrity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.01,0:03:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这具皮囊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this vessel, it was…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.93,0:03:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾被一个大天使粉碎到亚原子级\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was ripped apart on a subatomic level by an archangel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.17,0:03:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你怎么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then how are you…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.25,0:03:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被重新组装到一起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was reassembled.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.09,0:03:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲上天堂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father is in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.37,0:03:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那恭喜他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yay for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.12,0:04:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 聊得很愉快 滚出我的生活吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, good talk. You can get the hell out of my life now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.95,0:04:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 克莱尔 - 干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Claire… - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.04,0:04:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.91,0:04:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经夺走了我的一切 你还想怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You took everything from me. What do you want now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.66,0:04:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么 我就是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.12,0:04:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来帮你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came here to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.78,0:04:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.83,0:04:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我给了你太多伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I've hurt you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.41,0:04:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's your mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.71,0:04:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你走后几个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}About a few months after you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.61,0:04:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,她跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}she took off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.41,0:04:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我丢在了奶奶家 去「寻找自我」了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dropped me off at my grandma's and went to go "find herself."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.65,0:04:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来她还没找到呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess she's still looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.16,0:04:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被关在了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're in a…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.60,0:04:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿童监狱里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Child prison?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.47,0:04:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是教养院\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a group home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.27,0:05:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,奶奶死后 我没有别的亲人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}After my gran died, I didn't have anyone, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.30,0:05:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是就在各种寄养家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bounced around to different foster families,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.88,0:05:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,和这种地方辗转\N{\fnArial\fs30}places like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.15,0:05:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直梦想成真\N{\fnArial\fs30}Living the dream, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.95,0:05:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Claire, I'm sorry, and…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.86,0:05:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远无法替代我夺去的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can never replace what I took from you,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.42,0:05:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果你需要什么 任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if there is anything you need, anything at all…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.72,0:05:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我弄出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.52,0:05:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.81,0:05:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有领带吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you own a tie?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.66,0:05:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,别摆弄了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.91,0:05:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.87,0:05:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下你有当爹的样子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you look like a dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.95,0:05:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.18,0:05:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.63,0:05:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺瓦克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Novak,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.07,0:06:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说你想得到你女儿的监护权\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand you want custody of your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.89,0:06:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, that's, uh, that's…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.55,0:06:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.55,0:06:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.60,0:06:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.96,0:06:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个问题很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a simple question.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.86,0:06:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你消失了好几年\N{\fnArial\fs30}You vanish for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.05,0:06:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不联络 圣诞节都不寄贺卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}No contact, not even a christmas card.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.56,0:06:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么现在回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why come back now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.51,0:06:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…我没有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, um… I didn't, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.45,0:06:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我一直在外旅行 - 公差\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was traveling. - For work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.20,0:06:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,公差 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Work. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.10,0:06:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,去了好久啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.70,0:06:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是做什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what is it that you do exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.90,0:06:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…um…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.39,0:06:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对抗一些对人类致命的威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fight certain deadly threats to humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.08,0:06:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是个除虫员 - 我是除虫员\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's an exterminator. - I'm an exterminator.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.57,0:07:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好像有臭虫呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I think I might have bedbugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.71,0:07:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,能给点建议吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any tips?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.77,0:07:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.48,0:07:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好睡 别被臭虫咬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should sleep tight and not let them bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.52,0:07:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会试试的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll try that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.36,0:07:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.36,0:07:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's my dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.97,0:07:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想带我走 我就可以走\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he wants to sign me out, so I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.56,0:07:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是法律 桑迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the law, Sandy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.46,0:07:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔 去走廊等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire, wait for me in the hallway.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.74,0:07:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不能… - 快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can't… - Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.43,0:07:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢骗子 诺瓦克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't do well with liars, Mr. Novak.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.32,0:07:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是… - 省省吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But… - Save it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.66,0:07:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要拒绝你的监护权申请\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm denying your application for custody.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.43,0:07:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是想唱白脸 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not trying to be the bad guy here. I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.95,0:07:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但克莱尔成年之前 她都归我管\N{\fnArial\fs30}But until Claire turns 18, she is my responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.67,0:07:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是想做你认为正确的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're trying to do what you think is best.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.50,0:07:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你想做她的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you wanna be her friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.04,0:07:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.04,0:08:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题就在这里 诺瓦克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's our problem, Mr. Novak.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.27,0:08:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire's troubled.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.60,0:08:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这几年她过得不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last few years have not been easy for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.83,0:08:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,她需要的不是朋友 而是父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she doesn't need a friend. She needs a father.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.53,0:08:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.05,0:08:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,笑什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you laughing at?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.06,0:08:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.02,0:08:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看 这太经典了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a… this is a classic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.35,0:08:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴你感觉好些了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you're feeling better.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.34,0:08:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, better than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.61,0:08:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 美人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.61,0:08:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.61,0:08:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要跟它独处一会儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want some alone time with that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.88,0:08:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.92,0:08:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的 - 嗯 看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You sure? - Yeah. Yeah. Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.52,0:09:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 别啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Don't be…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.81,0:09:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.11,0:09:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.41,0:09:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.33,0:09:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.40,0:09:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要带你出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.29,0:09:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.27,0:09:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.12,0:10:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.66,0:10:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.67,0:10:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖狗狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.36,0:10:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.61,0:10:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.96,0:10:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要跟他说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.96,0:10:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,都好几周了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.44,0:10:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他说 我很对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.23,0:10:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.96,0:10:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.54,0:10:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.87,0:10:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该吃点蔬菜什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just…you could eat a vegetable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.27,0:11:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,番茄酱就是蔬菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ketchup's a vegetable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.19,0:11:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.82,0:11:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识的那个卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Castiel I met?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.73,0:11:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是个东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was crappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.39,0:11:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,又拽又混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, super stuck-up and a dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.16,0:11:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,让人想一拳打在他的天使脸上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you just wanted to punch him in his stupid angel face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.18,0:11:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我还不至于吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think I was that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.57,0:11:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You totally were.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.21,0:11:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you're just…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.90,0:11:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么说呢 待人亲多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Nicer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.79,0:11:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点呆 别介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}And kind of a doof. No offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.76,0:11:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Well, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.64,0:11:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前的确很自以为是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before, I was very self-assured.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.80,0:11:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我坚信自己走的是正义之道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was convinced I was on this righteous path.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.69,0:11:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我知道根本没有这回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I realize that there is no righteous path,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.66,0:11:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,人只能在一个太容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}just people trying to do their best.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.30,0:11:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,堕落的世界里 尽力而为\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a world where it's far too easy to do your worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.85,0:11:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好深刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.67,0:11:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 对呆子来说还不错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. For a doof.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.79,0:12:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.84,0:12:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们接下来去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…where do we go next?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.47,0:12:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢你请我吃饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look… I appreciate the meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.53,0:12:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,并犯下重罪解救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, you know, the felony.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.79,0:12:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不用给我当保姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you don't need to babysit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.77,0:12:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能照顾自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can take care of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.92,0:12:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.51,0:12:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得愧疚 所以救我出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean you felt guilty, so you busted me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.06,0:12:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 但我们两清了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So thanks, but we're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.90,0:12:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁也不欠谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even Steven.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.82,0:12:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们犯了罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we, um, we committed a crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.04,0:12:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能还会需要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you might need me again,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.26,0:12:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们还是待在一起吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I think we should stick together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.47,0:12:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.69,0:12:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,要买点东西上路吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna get some stuff for the road, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.63,0:12:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得去尿尿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to pee.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.78,0:12:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.87,0:12:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 - 怪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry. - My bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.90,0:13:14.52,Note,0,0,0,0,,（青少年杂志）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.85,0:13:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,给小姑娘买的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's for a teenage girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.00,0:13:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,她去上厕所了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's urinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.97,0:13:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的钱包没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wallet's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.13,0:13:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮忙 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, can you help? Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.39,0:13:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮忙 拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.52,0:13:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 克莱尔 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Claire. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.52,0:13:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.35,0:14:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 克莱尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! Hey! Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.73,0:14:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就为这事找我们 这就是你的「急事」\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is why you called us? This is your emergency?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.30,0:14:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.15,0:14:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.87,0:14:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人死了才叫急事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}An emergency is a dead body, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.64,0:14:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者天使发狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or… or… or a wigged out angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.24,0:14:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者天启第三次卷土重来\N{\fnArial\fs30}or the apocalypse, take 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.55,0:14:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个小丫头从你眼皮底下跑了这不叫急事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some chick bolting on you is not an emergency. That's…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.30,0:14:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆每周五晚上都能遇到\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's every Friday night for Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.87,0:14:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂喂 - 就是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dude. - Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.26,0:14:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不是什么小丫头\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't just some chick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.62,0:14:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要对她负责的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm responsible for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.91,0:14:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么啊 你多少年前见过她一面来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since when? You met her once… how many years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.43,0:14:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 就算我们找到了克莱尔 然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Cass, even if we do find Claire, then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.06,0:14:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,她抢了你 然后跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She rolled you and then she ran, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.27,0:14:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,她显然不想跟你过家家\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's pretty clear that she doesn't wanna play house.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.58,0:14:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.95,0:14:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我得确保克莱尔的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I need to know that Claire is safe,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.93,0:14:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你们帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.84,0:15:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.80,0:15:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去教养院打听一下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we go ask around at the group home?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.49,0:15:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.29,0:15:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们留下 以防她回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna stick here in case she circles back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.72,0:15:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.00,0:15:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.77,0:15:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,番茄酱是蔬菜吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is ketchup a vegetable?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.91,0:15:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.61,0:15:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,说吧 为什么要搞家人团聚这一出\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so spill. What's with the family reunion?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.70,0:15:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不清\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.67,0:15:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在想人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just been… thinking about people.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.09,0:15:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.17,0:15:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮过一些人 但也伤害了一些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've helped some, but I've… I've hurt some.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.48,0:15:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是中年危机了呗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're having a midlife crisis.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.21,0:15:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很老了 我觉得我有这权利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm extremely old. I think I'm entitled.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.72,0:15:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.53,0:15:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些事你必须放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's some stuff you just gotta let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.77,0:15:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.50,0:16:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你辜负的人 你没能救下的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people you let down, the ones you can't save…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.76,0:16:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能忘了他们 这是为了你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta forget about 'em, for your own good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.85,0:16:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就这么做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.15,0:16:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全不这么做 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the opposite of what I do. But…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.85,0:16:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不是什么好榜样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't exactly a role model.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.58,0:16:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.75,0:16:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,少来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.75,0:16:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.74,0:16:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.79,0:16:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.60,0:16:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.49,0:16:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有黑眼了 这是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I've lost the black eyes, so that's a plus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.19,0:16:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我还有这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I still have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.46,0:16:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,该隐血印对你还有影响吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Mark of Cain still affecting you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.59,0:16:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.98,0:17:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 答应我一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, I need you to promise me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.49,0:17:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.62,0:17:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我真投入了黑暗 你得干掉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I do go dark side, you gotta take me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.02,0:17:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.04,0:17:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,捅我 灭我 把我丢进太阳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knife me, smite me, throw me into the freakin' sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.47,0:17:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.59,0:17:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让萨姆拦你 他肯定要试的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't let Sam get in the way, because he'll try.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.32,0:17:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能再走那条路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't go down that road again, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.22,0:17:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能再成为恶魔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't be that thing again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.33,0:17:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会管用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.56,0:17:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,又没问你 勇敢的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't ask you, braveheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.76,0:17:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freedom!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.34,0:17:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么被关了进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…what are we in for?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.93,0:17:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是唠唠嗑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Small talk, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.06,0:17:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,消磨时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just passing the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.89,0:17:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这儿是因为我不该在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here because I shouldn't be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.35,0:18:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是谜语吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a riddle?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.16,0:18:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力只允许一部分恶魔上地面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley only allows certain demons to come earth-side.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.60,0:18:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在获批名单上 所以自己想办法溜了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't on the list, so I had to get myself smuggled up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.54,0:18:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你拿什么交换的 - 做件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And what did that cost? - A favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.90,0:18:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大事吗 - 很血腥\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Big? - Bloody.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.13,0:18:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜大王会让我关一阵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…I figure the king lets me stew for a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.06,0:18:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就会来审问我怎么逃出地狱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}then he starts asking how I Houdini'd hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.19,0:18:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且他不会客气的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he ain't gonna ask nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.04,0:18:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.24,0:18:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your sin?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.02,0:18:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个糟糕透顶的母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a horrible mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.48,0:18:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是个糟糕透顶的母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was a horrible mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.55,0:18:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟没跟你提过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I tell you the time that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.58,0:18:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,她差点拿我去换3头猪的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}she almost traded me for three pigs?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.44,0:18:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,3头啊 我小时候很可爱呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three! I was an attractive child.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.08,0:18:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,还会杂耍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could juggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.37,0:18:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少也值5头猪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was worth five pigs at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.69,0:18:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈妈会拿烟头烫我\N{\fnArial\fs30}My ma used to burn me with cigarettes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.59,0:18:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人在乎 杰拉德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody cares, Gerald.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.68,0:19:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,更别提名字了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get me started about the name.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.83,0:19:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,费格斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Fergus."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.35,0:19:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着像性病\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sounds like a venereal disease,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.57,0:19:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是很讨厌的那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not the fun kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.72,0:19:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, boss,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.82,0:19:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你这么讨厌这女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you hate this Betty so much,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.13,0:19:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}why not end her?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.98,0:19:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自有原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've my reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.35,0:19:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就杀了我妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I killed my old lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.07,0:19:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为她拿烟头烫我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of the cigarettes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.00,0:19:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我乐意杀了你妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no problem doing yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.62,0:19:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔是个好孩子 警探 很聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire's a good kid, detective. She's smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.32,0:19:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 她其实很善良\N{\fnArial\fs30}And underneath it all, she has a big heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.49,0:19:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里以前有个男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, there used to be a boy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.34,0:19:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,达斯汀·塔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dustin Tate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.98,0:19:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他年长一些 但克莱尔很照顾他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was older, but Claire really took him under her wing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.89,0:19:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he around?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.10,0:19:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在香肠屋工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}He works at the Wiener Hut.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.33,0:19:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也想给克莱尔找家 但她总逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}We tried to place Claire, but she always ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.29,0:19:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候逃走几天 有次逃了半年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes for a couple of days, one time for six months.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.37,0:20:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,她待在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did she hide out?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.21,0:20:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wish I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.81,0:20:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.19,0:20:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰迪在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is, uh, Randy here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.76,0:20:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧谁回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Look who's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.43,0:20:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,都多久了 3天\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been…what? Three days?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.46,0:20:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我被抓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I got busted.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.06,0:20:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我带来了礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I come bearing gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.88,0:20:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里面有两百多呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's, like, 200 bucks in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.45,0:20:35.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（詹姆斯·诺瓦克）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.77,0:20:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯·诺瓦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}James Novak.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.41,0:20:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你亲戚吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any relation?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.86,0:20:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 就是个路人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. He's just a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.89,0:20:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢帮忙 不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well… I appreciate the elbow grease, but, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.60,0:20:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're still short.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.15,0:20:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,还差多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.57,0:20:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.12,0:20:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨林杰什么时候来收钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}When's Salinger coming to collect?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.02,0:20:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.20,0:21:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,都怪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.15,0:21:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不该借那么多钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shouldn't have borrowed so much money.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.33,0:21:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 圣诞要到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh, the holidays are coming,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.38,0:21:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想给孩子们买点好东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I like to spoil my kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.10,0:21:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许他会再宽限些时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he'll give us some more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.54,0:21:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是放高利贷的 那种人不会给你第二次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a loan shark. They're not so big on second chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.57,0:21:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kinda thought you were gonna…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.32,0:21:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会像我们说好的那样 偷到足够的钱还债\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steal enough to pay down the debt, like we talked about.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.55,0:21:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.28,0:21:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.70,0:21:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不够努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not hard enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.53,0:21:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.19,0:21:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一顿家庭晚餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}One last family meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.56,0:21:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们肯定还有办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gotta be something we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.87,0:21:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.53,0:21:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nothin'. It's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.66,0:21:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我还未成年 我就去做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd do it if I was still under 18.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.11,0:21:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.41,0:22:00.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（香肠屋）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.21,0:22:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,达斯汀·塔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dustin Tate?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.67,0:22:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.46,0:22:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.57,0:22:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.80,0:22:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我克莱尔·诺瓦克在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're gonna tell me where Claire Novak is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.01,0:22:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.46,0:22:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是听他的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd do what he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.76,0:22:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,快进快出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick in, quick out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.83,0:22:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心摄像头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out for the cameras.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.44,0:22:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.97,0:22:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,等到只剩下你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait till you're alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.21,0:22:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后狠狠收拾那个收银员\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you hit that register jockey hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.56,0:22:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他吓破胆 懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put the fear of god in him. You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.91,0:22:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.26,0:22:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后回到我身边来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You come back to me, you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.03,0:23:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和达斯汀 你们是我仅有的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Dustin… you're the only family I got.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.30,0:23:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.89,0:23:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 克莱尔 等等 - 去你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Claire, wait! - Screw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.32,0:23:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,别激动啊 小刺头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Miley Cyrus, settle.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.73,0:23:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死吧 老头子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat me, Hasselhoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.84,0:23:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔 别激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire, hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.83,0:23:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我叫… - 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, my name's… - Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.41,0:24:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.74,0:24:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们见过的 记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've met, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.08,0:24:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.50,0:24:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚是打算去打劫那个便利店吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were going to rob that convenience store?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.33,0:24:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.22,0:24:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.05,0:24:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…it's…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.90,0:24:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.00,0:24:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想对我说教是与非吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna talk to me about wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.97,0:24:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.30,0:24:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对你而言算是滔天大错了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that wrong enough for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.56,0:24:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 我没杀他 - 真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, I didn't. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.12,0:24:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为要不是你 他就还会在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because without you, he'd still be here,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.47,0:24:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈妈也还会在\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my mom would still be around.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.03,0:24:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire, I'm…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.54,0:24:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,别过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.56,0:24:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那伤不了我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That won't hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.59,0:24:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.88,0:24:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拜托 - 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, come on. - Hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.86,0:24:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.38,0:24:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这难道不是你们自找的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you don't have it coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.90,0:24:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个怪物占据了我爸 你们却袖手旁观\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stood there while this monster took my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.32,0:25:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经向你祷告 卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to pray to you, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.65,0:25:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every night.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.87,0:25:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我祈求你把他安全地带回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would beg you to bring him home safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.82,0:25:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.78,0:25:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.90,0:25:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father was a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.01,0:25:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这世界多么黑白颠倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}In what messed up world.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.99,0:25:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就得死 而你却能活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}does he have to die and you get to live?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.73,0:25:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.55,0:25:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你只是觉得愧疚\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You feel guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.69,0:25:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这两者是不一样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.31,0:25:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你要跑回兰迪那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what, now you run back to Randy,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.15,0:25:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑回指使你偷东西的人那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}the guy you steal for?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.50,0:25:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道的 - 达斯汀\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do you know about that? - Dustin.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.08,0:25:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.79,0:25:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那男人在利用你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That man is using you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.30,0:25:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他保护了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was there for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.66,0:25:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,当情况变坏的时候 急转直下的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When things got bad … and they got real damn bad …
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.46,0:25:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了他没有别人帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}he was there when no one else was.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.61,0:25:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's my family,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.38,0:26:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你只不过是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're just…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.91,0:26:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你下地狱吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.93,0:26:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大要见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boss will see you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.75,0:26:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.50,0:26:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,费格斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fergus.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.49,0:26:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.91,0:26:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,费格斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fergus.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.85,0:26:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没变\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you haven't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.38,0:26:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你却绝对变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you certainly have.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.84,0:26:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱之王 厉害啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}King of Hell. Bravo.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.18,0:27:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直知道我儿子注定要成大事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always knew my boy was meant for big things.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.20,0:27:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.27,0:27:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I remember it,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.38,0:27:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过我会死在哪个阴沟里\N{\fnArial\fs30}you said I would die in a gutter,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.49,0:27:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,淹没在我自己的呕吐物里\N{\fnArial\fs30}covered in my own sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.35,0:27:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在激励你做得更好点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was motivating you to do better.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.25,0:27:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标更高远一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aim higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.87,0:27:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且显然 这起作用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And clearly, it worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.22,0:27:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you die?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.81,0:27:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,重点是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The point is,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.17,0:27:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你恨我\N{\fnArial\fs30}you hated me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.05,0:27:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.58,0:27:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说 你马上就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you'd be back in a flash,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.65,0:27:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你就消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then you disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.90,0:27:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时才8岁 8岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was 8 years old! 8!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.74,0:27:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, now you're being dramatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.06,0:27:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我都没有爸爸 - 你当然有爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I didn't even have a father! - Of course you had a father.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.41,0:27:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在一次冬至群交中怀上你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were just conceived during a winter solstice orgy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.34,0:27:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又不会问对方名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's not like I was taking names.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.32,0:27:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让我说什么 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want me to say? I…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.68,0:27:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟当地人起了点争执\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a…disagreement with the locals. And.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.65,0:27:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们放出猎犬追我 我当然得跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}when they set their hounds on me, I had to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.97,0:27:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑了就不回来了 跑了几百年\N{\fnArial\fs30}And never come back? For hundreds of years?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.36,0:28:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我现在来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.87,0:28:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a second chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.67,0:28:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以再次成为一家人 费格斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can be a real family again, Fergus.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.01,0:28:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.09,0:28:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我有家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.93,0:28:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁 恶魔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who? The demons?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.72,0:28:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们如果觉得能得逞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any one of them would stab you in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.69,0:28:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,都会毫不犹豫地出卖你\N{\fnArial\fs30}if they thought they could get away with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.18,0:28:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不会吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you wouldn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.56,0:28:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会 我们是一家人 我们血脉相连\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Because we're family! We're blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.61,0:28:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can trust me,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.36,0:28:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.00,0:28:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白你很愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand you're angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.03,0:28:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand that you…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.66,0:28:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,恨我\N{\fnArial\fs30}hate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.03,0:28:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想继续锁着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you want to keep me locked away,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.08,0:28:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}then so be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.12,0:28:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但要知道 我永远是你妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}But know that I'll always be your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.80,0:28:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会永远爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll always love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.79,0:29:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a shot of, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.78,0:29:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,三杯威士忌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three whiskeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.67,0:29:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 别太责备自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, don't beat yourself up, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.80,0:29:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire was…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.82,0:29:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.30,0:29:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.21,0:29:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有什么资格教她怎么生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who am I to tell her how to live her life?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.44,0:29:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,总得有人教她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, somebody needs to.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.43,0:29:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可不是什么特雷莎修女\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like we're talking about mother Teresa here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.84,0:29:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那姑娘差点去抢便利店\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl just about knocked over a gas 'n sip.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.46,0:29:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她有问题 - 是我造成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's got issues. - Because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.04,0:29:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还穿着她老爸的肉身呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you are wearing her old man's meatsuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.73,0:29:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许只能火上浇油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably didn't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.42,0:29:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我能弥补她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I could make it up to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.97,0:29:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你弥补不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.11,0:29:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉米是她父亲 对某些人来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Jimmy was her father. And to some people, that's…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.87,0:29:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是一切 你明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's everything, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.42,0:29:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不明白 我并不了解我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I don't. I never knew my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.21,0:30:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少可以说 他一直很疏远\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was distant, to say the least.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.12,0:30:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们呢 你们爱你们的父亲吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you? Did you love your father?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.67,0:30:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,全心全意\N{\fnArial\fs30}With everything I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.12,0:30:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.65,0:30:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时很不容易 但我们爱他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I mean, it wasn't always easy, but yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.83,0:30:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰·温彻斯特绝对算不上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, look, John Winchester's not gonna win.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.13,0:30:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,「最佳老爸」 好吧 但…\N{\fnArial\fs30}any "Number one dad" awards, you know? But…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.59,0:30:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有需要的时候 他都在\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, damn if he wasn't there when we needed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.92,0:30:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他说说纽约那次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him about that time in New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.35,0:30:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.00,0:30:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, okay. So, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.35,0:30:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时我们在长岛猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were working this haunting in long island,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.70,0:30:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我和萨姆恳求老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}and … and me and sam begged the old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.14,0:30:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们进一次城\N{\fnArial\fs30}to let us go to the city for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.73,0:30:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对纽约有点偏见\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had this thing about New York, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.10,0:30:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,觉得那里太大 太吵 太脏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too big, too loud, too dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.98,0:30:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 而且他讨厌洋基队 - 超级讨厌 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, and he hated the yankees. - Big-time. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.27,0:30:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 我们说服了他让我们去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somehow, we convinced him to let us go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.80,0:30:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们都去了 到处逛景点\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we all go. We all, you know, see all the sights,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.19,0:30:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐了地铁 吃了很多披萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, uh, ride the subway, eat too much pizza,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.44,0:30:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,全玩了个遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}the whole nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.01,0:30:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了半夜 萨姆和爸都精疲力尽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, by about midnight, Sam and dad are zonked,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.92,0:31:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 管他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I figure, screw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.44,0:31:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去{\u1}摇滚俱乐部{\u0}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to CBGB.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.58,0:31:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- CBGB是… - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So CBGB is … I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.46,0:31:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷蒙斯乐队和金发美女乐队就是在那儿起家的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's where the Ramones and Blondie got their start.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.21,0:31:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.16,0:31:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, anyways,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.58,0:31:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时候他年龄还远远不到能进酒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}he was way underage at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.65,0:31:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, so I get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.99,0:31:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,溜了进去 那里简直是疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sneak in, and it is nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.11,0:31:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,人人都喝得醉醺醺的 吞云吐雾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, people are drinking and they're smoking.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.81,0:31:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知在吸食什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they're … they're snortin' whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.06,0:31:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个顶着莫霍克头的大块头在台上咆哮\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a 500-pound guy on stage with a Mohawk just screamin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.94,0:31:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的脑子快爆炸了 根本不知道该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh, my mind is blown. I don't even know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.15,0:31:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后一个女孩走过来对我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then this girl walks up and she says,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.47,0:31:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,「好啊 来我们桌坐坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Hey, why don't you come over and sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.32,0:31:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我的朋友聊聊天吧「\N{\fnArial\fs30}with my friends at our table?"
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.71,0:31:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我说好 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. - Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.47,0:31:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他们把他灌醉了 第一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they get him drunk. First time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.97,0:31:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那感觉可不好受\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not fun drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.71,0:31:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不确定他们往酒里放了什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not quite sure what was in that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.22,0:31:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个房间都转了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the room starts to spin.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.46,0:31:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我要吐了 一直吐下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I feel like I'm gonna puke. Forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.18,0:31:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那时\N{\fnArial\fs30}And right about that time,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.05,0:31:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到了他叫我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.33,0:31:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,「迪恩·温切斯特」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dean Winchester!"
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.02,0:31:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我老爹\N{\fnArial\fs30}My old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.42,0:31:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道他怎么做到的 他找到了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how, but he found me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.85,0:32:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全吓坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now I'm really freaking out,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.95,0:32:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他就那么站在那里 一言不发\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause he's just standing there, not saying anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.33,0:32:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看看周围 所有人都吓坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I look around. Everybody else is freaking out, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.32,0:32:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人敢直视他的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, nobody's even looking him in the eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.81,0:32:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后 一个鼻子里穿了根安全别针\N{\fnArial\fs30}And finally, this one guy with, like, a safety pin through his nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.07,0:32:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,身上纹了「挡我者死」的男人抬起头\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a-a "Kill everything" tattoo looks up,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.64,0:32:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,对他说「对不起 先生」\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he says, "Sorry, sir."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.95,0:32:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,「对不起 先生」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.46,0:32:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,对约翰·吓死人·温切斯特说\N{\fnArial\fs30}To John Friggin' Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.23,0:32:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他救了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He saved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.52,0:32:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 可你知道我怎么回报他的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. And you know what he got for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.61,0:32:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我埋怨他让我当众丢人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me whining about how much he embarrassed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.89,0:32:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对他说我恨他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me telling him that I hate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.07,0:32:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他站住了 转过身来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then he stopped, he turned around.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.03,0:32:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he looked at me and he said,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.47,0:32:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,「儿子 你不喜欢我 没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Son, you don't like me? That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.99,0:32:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,做爸爸的不一定要你喜欢「\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not my job to be liked.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.74,0:32:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,「但我要把你好好养大」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"It's my job to raise you right."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.82,0:32:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 他做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. And he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.88,0:33:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们觉得克莱尔会不会有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think Claire is in trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.29,0:33:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她跟一个叫兰迪的人在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's hanging out with a guy named Randy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.39,0:33:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 必须有麻烦 - 马上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's in trouble. - Coming right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.44,0:33:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Randy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.79,0:33:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好 小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evenin', little lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.57,0:33:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.04,0:33:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带了什么东西给我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have something for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.27,0:33:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.65,0:33:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,亮枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guns blazing, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.83,0:33:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你的计划吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was your plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.44,0:33:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.86,0:33:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这烂人 不值得你这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}This pile of crap? He ain't worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.42,0:34:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她关到别的房间去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put her in the other room.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.83,0:34:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有股狠劲 我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's got fight. I like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.16,0:34:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,上一个往我脸上吐唾沫的妹子 我娶了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I married the last girl that spit in my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.29,0:34:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去几个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last few months,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.24,0:34:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赌马输了很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've lost a bundle on the ponies.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.76,0:34:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在欠我多少钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much you owe me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.31,0:34:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,5000美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}$5, 000.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.55,0:34:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如 我饶你一马\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how about I give you a break?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.24,0:34:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把那姑娘给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you give me the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.08,0:34:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开玩笑呢吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a joke, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.19,0:34:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔对我来说就像家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire's like family to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.20,0:34:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了 我了解这骗术 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. I know the con, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.69,0:34:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找一个有恋父情结的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You find some kid with major league daddy issues,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.66,0:34:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后让她为你偷窃\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then you get her to steal for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.08,0:34:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,别装骄傲的父亲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut the proud papa act.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.05,0:34:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你个好价码\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll make you a good deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.90,0:35:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.89,0:35:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔是我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire's family.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.26,0:35:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你的价码得够好\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it better be a damn good deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.75,0:35:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.09,0:35:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.82,0:35:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道是谁在往地面偷运灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know who's been smuggling souls up from hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.47,0:35:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗 快说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Pray do tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.63,0:35:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.14,0:35:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.78,0:35:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的 先生 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It … it's true, mister… Uh, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.53,0:35:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰拉德他…我们做了交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gerald, he… we made a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.61,0:35:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.74,0:35:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 她为什么要说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Why would she lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.86,0:36:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 杰拉德\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's enough of that, Gerald.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.75,0:36:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀了你 贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll kill you, bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.53,0:36:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 杰拉德\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's enough, Gerald.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.52,0:36:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,快死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.46,0:36:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了够了 杰拉德\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said that's enough, Gerald.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.69,0:36:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.81,0:36:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.25,0:36:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗威娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rowena.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.24,0:36:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过如果我撒谎 你就会把我救出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said that if I lied, you'd get me out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.72,0:36:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and I will, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.30,0:36:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be back in a flash.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.39,0:37:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫克莱尔 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Claire, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.06,0:37:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的很漂亮 你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really are a pretty one, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.75,0:38:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.54,0:38:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,别过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.94,0:38:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那女孩在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.63,0:38:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.20,0:38:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.17,0:38:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱尔 克莱尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claire. Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.17,0:38:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Randy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.53,0:38:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,带她离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get her outta here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.05,0:38:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.21,0:38:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.76,0:38:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,别过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, back up!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.24,0:38:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,别过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back up!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.95,0:39:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,别犯傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be as dumb as you look.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.41,0:39:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不会想这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys don't wanna do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.04,0:39:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.14,0:39:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.77,0:40:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.48,0:40:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.33,0:40:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你是没别的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me you had to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.93,0:40:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I did…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.93,0:40:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不是有意的 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I didn't mean to. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.71,0:40:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 是因为他们还是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me it was them or you!
